$x$ with $-1$ in the expression and evaluate the parentheses first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1+(2-3x) & = \\\\ 1+(2-3\\cdot (-1)) & = \\\\ 1+(2-(-3)) & = \\\\ 1+(2+3) & = \\\\ 1+5 & = \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186536895 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054841 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "6d42c63b-4549-5ed0-8da5-72561253acb9" :knowledge-point/title "Evaluating Expressions Containing Multiple Variables"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6d10c19e-e150-55eb-b24f-880c7b312823" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536466} {:answer/id #uuid "a3b3c01c-522f-573c-9eb2-ad4d95b6fe5d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536548} {:answer/id #uuid "aabb5221-9e59-59ad-89e3-cdfd40a76ef1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-22" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536557} {:answer/id #uuid "ceffc3ea-0be6-5e49-bd61-93965c77fc7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536609} {:answer/id #uuid "ee0c7ef3-1224-563f-ab0a-0e9a6c26a9b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "22" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536662}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ceffc3ea-0be6-5e49-bd61-93965c77fc7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536609} :answer-field/id #uuid "bd06868d-23f4-5b1c-a48c-3253d06db7ac" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536783}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f350f45b-6b40-5442-831e-bda149e4ff5d" :question/math-academy-id "q-41203" :question/problem "If $p=2$ and $q=-2,$ then $8p+7q+2=$" :question/worked-solution "Replacing $p$ with $2$ and $q$ with $-2$ in the expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8p+7q+2 & = \\\\ 8(2)+7(-2)+2 & = \\\\ 16+(-14)+2 & = \\\\ 16-14+2 & = \\\\ 4.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
